WEBVTT

1
00:00:21.987 --> 00:00:26.553
Too much. Too much for me. All right.

2
00:00:26.995 --> 00:00:30.744
May God bless you.

3
00:01:39.382 --> 00:01:53.112
So today we are celebrating the Birthday of Shri Ganesha because that's a very important thing

4
00:01:53.283 --> 00:01:58.643
for all of us that we should celebrate His Birthday. And yesterday we did the Havan.

5
00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:07.803
But yesterday we had many new people so I couldn't talk to you very clearly about

6
00:02:07.896 --> 00:02:12.775
Shri Ganesha’s deeper manifestations.

7
00:02:14.559 --> 00:02:18.498
You know that He resides within us.

8
00:02:30.421 --> 00:02:46.221
Now, we have a very great asset within us that we know about Shri Ganesha

9
00:02:46.762 --> 00:02:52.659
and that we can excite His powers within us.

10
00:02:52.675 --> 00:02:57.062
Now who is start translate? Come along. Just come along.

11
00:03:21.023 --> 00:03:33.037
To manifest Shri Ganesha, we have to do certain amount of Tapasya, Penance.

12
00:03:41.006 --> 00:03:46.408
First we have to say, when we sit for meditation, that:

13
00:03:46.486 --> 00:04:05.718
“I am going to be worthy of Your appreciation.

14
00:04:05.718 --> 00:04:26.682
Make me humble, so that I am appreciated by You, and my only desire is to please You”.

15
00:04:26.798 --> 00:04:35.642
Then you sit down in complete preparedness, meditating over your Mooladhara,

16
00:04:35.727 --> 00:04:39.399
putting your attention to it with absolute purity.

17
00:04:51.012 --> 00:04:55.658
Now you have my photograph before you and you tell the photograph that:

18
00:04:55.751 --> 00:05:03.408
“Mother, You who are Shri Ganesha, Shri Ganesha,

19
00:05:03.493 --> 00:05:08.519
You give me wisdom and discretion”.

20
00:05:26.799 --> 00:05:33.336
So, attention at the mooladhara chakra, which is actually below the sacrum bone.

21
00:05:38.405 --> 00:05:48.043
You put your right hand towards the photograph, and left hand on the Mother Earth.

22
00:05:56.377 --> 00:06:10.414
Now this will tell you that your mind, or your brain which is full of confusion,

23
00:06:10.576 --> 00:06:21.878
which has no discretion, which is complicated, which does the same mistakes again and again,

24
00:06:21.994 --> 00:06:35.762
which does not understand how to cure the ills of bad thinking,

25
00:06:35.855 --> 00:06:41.949
all that can be cured if you put the right hand towards me and the left hand towards the Mother Earth.

26
00:06:42.049 --> 00:06:45.393
So, in action you do like that.

27
00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:19.949
Now as He is the essence of everything that is material, that has Bhava , that has been created.

28
00:07:20.079 --> 00:07:25.831
He is the essence of everything that has been created. Through Him everything has been created.

29
00:07:37.542 --> 00:07:43.990
You, when you develop that, you develop your sense of subtle creativity.

30
00:07:50.269 --> 00:07:55.682
And the sense of subtle appreciation of creativity.

31
00:08:01.039 --> 00:08:04.694
Then you develop your discretion how to behave

32
00:08:11.376 --> 00:08:14.601
with others in a beautiful manner

33
00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:22.460
so that your ego is controlled.

34
00:08:25.507 --> 00:08:33.500
The behaviour should be such that there should be no expression of ego in your behaviour.

35
00:08:39.453 --> 00:08:41.798
Your Mother is a good example.

36
00:08:46.689 --> 00:08:50.195
I think you know I know quite a lot of things,

37
00:08:53.683 --> 00:08:55.288
but I never show off,

38
00:08:57.055 --> 00:08:59.040
nor ever assert

39
00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:02.418
that I'm so knowledgeable.

40
00:09:04.193 --> 00:09:08.351
I live like a very very ordinary person with you

41
00:09:11.777 --> 00:09:19.195
and I do not, in any way, assert my personality

42
00:09:19.265 --> 00:09:21.698
that would shock.

43
00:09:26.861 --> 00:09:34.265
So, with your intelligence or with your other powers like if you are a moneyed man

44
00:09:34.265 --> 00:09:37.173
or if you are more efficient, or anything,

45
00:09:37.204 --> 00:09:40.210
you should not try to impress on others.

46
00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:54.846
But you must deal with it beautifully.

47
00:10:01.924 --> 00:10:07.567
So the beauty comes when you are efficient and you are loving.

48
00:10:11.458 --> 00:10:13.771
That's the central point, that's the effect.

49
00:10:15.856 --> 00:10:20.241
That you are knowledgeable and you are humble.

50
00:10:26.513 --> 00:10:32.279
That you know everything about everyone but you are discreet.

51
00:10:38.217 --> 00:10:49.897
So in effect it is a complete personality that can only give that kind of a very soothing effect.

52
00:11:03.352 --> 00:11:11.261
So the soothing effect comes as a result of beauty. That much creativity.

53
00:11:16.858 --> 00:11:22.243
So to develop it you have to meditate on your mooladhara chakra.

54
00:11:26.499 --> 00:11:30.850
I have seen many people get fanatic about Sahaja Yoga also.

55
00:11:35.493 --> 00:11:39.910
They think they are the real Napoleons or Shivaji!

56
00:11:50.607 --> 00:11:53.802
What you call Shrivaji. In Marathi, we call him Shivaji,

57
00:11:53.934 --> 00:11:58.340
but Shivaji was a much better person than Napoleon, better to call him Napoleon.

58
00:12:02.945 --> 00:12:06.419
Then they start guiding you in everything: "Тhis is not good, that's not good,

59
00:12:06.466 --> 00:12:09.998
I'm a great Sahaja Yogi, I'm like this...” and all that.

60
00:12:10.099 --> 00:12:12.220
And very hot tempered.

61
00:12:18.336 --> 00:12:22.612
Because they are fanatics. Fanaticism and temper goes together.

62
00:12:22.612 --> 00:12:24.496
Therе's no love in fanaticism.

63
00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:35.083
If you tell them: "Don’t be a fanatic.", they'll start crying.

64
00:12:38.532 --> 00:12:42.551
So the fanaticism of Sahaja Yoga is most blinding.

65
00:12:46.636 --> 00:12:53.338
It is something like: in front of the Temple of God you beg from other people for money.

66
00:13:00.028 --> 00:13:04.583
Sahaja Yoga is one thing which should not lead you to any fanaticism.

67
00:13:10.040 --> 00:13:17.321
You have to be Prasanna Chitta. Means you should be a very happy, joyous personality.

68
00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:28.000
And not a tense, abrupt person.

69
00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:40.625
But this only achieves it’s maximum result when everything is done in complete innocence.

70
00:13:46.641 --> 00:13:49.741
But many people confuse innocence with stupidity.

71
00:13:53.501 --> 00:13:55.887
They think, to be stupid is innocent.

72
00:13:59.081 --> 00:14:02.221
And a stupid man gets into ego trip in no time.

73
00:14:07.035 --> 00:14:10.542
Innocence is the wisest thing.

74
00:14:13.418 --> 00:14:17.868
You can not befool innocence, that’s the main thing.

75
00:14:20.813 --> 00:14:24.014
No one can befool me, I am very innocent.

76
00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:32.329
Innocence is that which does not harm anyone,

77
00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:40.470
that doesn't think that it can solve the problems

78
00:14:43.113 --> 00:14:45.788
but it leaves everything for God to solve.

79
00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:51.172
It is just existence itself

80
00:14:54.614 --> 00:14:57.792
in the blessings of your Mother.

81
00:14:59.405 --> 00:15:12.608
As Ganesha was just living on the complete blessings of His Mother.

82
00:15:18.538 --> 00:15:20.716
It gives you concentration.

83
00:15:22.887 --> 00:15:29.829
Have you seen a child being nursed by mother, how concentrated the child is.

84
00:15:36.139 --> 00:15:38.294
Sucking everything in.

85
00:15:40.712 --> 00:15:46.935
It doesn’t bother who is who, where is he sitting, what is it, what is catching.

86
00:15:58.586 --> 00:16:10.009
It doesn’t bother as to who is next to you, what is your relationship with others.

87
00:16:17.885 --> 00:16:24.494
Or it doesn’t bother, at all, as to the future what he is to do next.

88
00:16:28.792 --> 00:16:30.986
So innocence keeps you in the present.

89
00:16:33.970 --> 00:16:36.243
Innocent man is permanently relaxed.

90
00:16:40.793 --> 00:16:45.093
Supposing I have to go today. Alright, so I’ll go at the time when I have to go.

91
00:16:50.193 --> 00:16:53.238
What’s the use of getting agitated about it?

92
00:16:56.144 --> 00:17:01.718
People get even ten days ahead agitated if they have to go after ten days.

93
00:17:07.206 --> 00:17:10.743
And when it really comes to going, they have forgotten everything.

94
00:17:13.658 --> 00:17:15.629
Because they are not in the present.

95
00:17:17.374 --> 00:17:22.866
So, to develop your innocence also is very good idea to be in the present.

96
00:17:27.502 --> 00:17:29.636
At the most what’s going to happen?

97
00:17:31.636 --> 00:17:34.463
I mean, whatever has to happen will happen in any case.

98
00:17:37.695 --> 00:17:38.982
So why worry?

99
00:17:40.641 --> 00:17:47.537
I am one person who is least worried and nothing has gone wrong with me so far.

100
00:18:00.731 --> 00:18:04.980
On the contrary, I play tricks that everything goes wrong with people like this.

101
00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:16.211
And I want them to learn that this is not so important.

102
00:18:20.312 --> 00:18:26.302
To keep yourself in the present is your job and leave everything to God.

103
00:18:31.759 --> 00:18:36.568
Because you don’t know when you are in the present you are in contact with Divine power.

104
00:18:40.963 --> 00:18:44.636
But when you get out of the present, you are not there.

105
00:18:47.388 --> 00:18:49.977
You are under your ego or superego.

106
00:18:54.365 --> 00:19:00.302
So for all of you I may try just to show that I am also playing with you, but be cafefull.

107
00:19:05.589 --> 00:19:09.754
I am least bothered about anything whatsoever.

108
00:19:15.266 --> 00:19:20.712
What is such a disasters you have seen in your life? Just tell me.

109
00:19:25.045 --> 00:19:29.508
I have seen the last dissolution of the whole universe.

110
00:19:33.229 --> 00:19:35.512
What can I fear anymore?

111
00:19:38.512 --> 00:19:43.926
So when you get upset, think of something very serious that has happened to you before.

112
00:19:52.353 --> 00:19:58.585
And then you'll not be so much worried about the non sensical little things here and there.

113
00:20:06.632 --> 00:20:10.054
So miraculous things will happen, through your innocence.

114
00:20:14.061 --> 00:20:18.349
The more innocent you are the more blissful you will be.

115
00:20:23.171 --> 00:20:31.524
Now, many people should try this thing: sitting in a group together, meditating,

116
00:20:31.633 --> 00:20:33.767
saying the mantra of Shri Ganesha.

117
00:20:40.581 --> 00:20:42.542
To try to build up.

118
00:20:45.635 --> 00:20:52.353
Those who think too much, they should also try to say: “Not this, not this, not this."

119
00:20:57.802 --> 00:21:02.955
Even the superego when it gives you thoughts, you should say: “Not this, not this, not this."

120
00:21:08.583 --> 00:21:14.714
So you will develop that state where you stand yourself and nothing else.

121
00:21:21.683 --> 00:21:26.436
So the innocence plays, but it is not involved.

122
00:21:31.196 --> 00:21:34.604
It sees the play, just sees.

123
00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:44.084
It enjoys the play, just enjoys.

124
00:21:48.584 --> 00:21:54.674
So today when we are thinking of Shri Ganesha, let us desire that

125
00:21:54.775 --> 00:22:04.345
within us, His great power of innocence, be enlightened.

126
00:22:15.755 --> 00:22:21.143
And He is, on the other side, the source of love.

127
00:22:24.639 --> 00:22:29.419
The source of emotional security.

128
00:22:33.651 --> 00:22:37.462
He’s like a child, a very charming, beautiful child.

129
00:22:41.369 --> 00:22:45.239
And people feel extremely...

130
00:22:49.596 --> 00:22:52.519
Charmed...? It's still one of them dirty words I think.

131
00:22:52.519 --> 00:22:58.728
Yogi: Attracted?, Shri Mataji: No, no, no., Yogi: Enchanted?, Shri Mataji: How to...

132
00:22:58.728 --> 00:23:10.211
You see it’s a paternal love. Is the praternal love, paternal enchantment. Leth's go to that. For him.

133
00:23:12.125 --> 00:23:15.436
Or motherly enchantment.

134
00:23:21.409 --> 00:23:25.113
Because ”charming” also is a very funny word.

135
00:23:25.237 --> 00:23:31.371
Because in the west people don’t understand even innocence towards children.

136
00:23:41.860 --> 00:23:48.390
So you have to be childlike, not childish, confusions must not be there.

137
00:23:52.793 --> 00:23:55.110
But some people confuse it.

138
00:23:56.955 --> 00:23:59.960
They think it should be like a big baby, you see.

139
00:24:04.030 --> 00:24:09.332
And that you have to be treated like a... In Marathi we just call him “Motha Bal” like a big baby.

140
00:24:09.548 --> 00:24:14.570
All the time, from bottle feeding, nappy changing...

141
00:24:23.286 --> 00:24:26.337
And there’s no end to it.

142
00:24:28.887 --> 00:24:36.004
So this kind of thing, if it is done to someone, that really will become a stupid fellow in no time.

143
00:24:44.523 --> 00:24:48.299
But Ganesha’s enchantment has dignity.

144
00:24:56.795 --> 00:25:01.110
He may look like a child, but He is an old man.

145
00:25:05.668 --> 00:25:07.810
He is the eldest of all.

146
00:25:13.043 --> 00:25:19.158
And despite all these years, he has kept His innocence intact.

147
00:25:24.057 --> 00:25:29.632
So, sometimes people confuse it with over doting or a

148
00:25:29.748 --> 00:25:35.826
sort of a caring too much and the innocent person doesn’t like it much.

149
00:25:44.191 --> 00:25:46.653
Even if somebody does it,

150
00:25:49.172 --> 00:25:52.770
He wouldn't mind, because it pleases the other person.

151
00:25:52.902 --> 00:25:55.900
But it does not go to his head or anything.

152
00:26:04.497 --> 00:26:09.988
On the contrary, when you are doting on such a person, you start learning.

153
00:26:15.244 --> 00:26:22.239
There was somebody like that who was expert on massaging the feet.

154
00:26:26.719 --> 00:26:29.421
So she said “Mother, you give me one hour one day,

155
00:26:29.460 --> 00:26:33.260
I'll come and massage your Feet because I have known that art”.

156
00:26:42.896 --> 00:26:45.655
I said alright, come such and such day.

157
00:26:49.059 --> 00:26:52.254
And when she started massaging my feet, you see,

158
00:26:52.386 --> 00:26:55.551
she said: “What's happening! It is me who is relaxing”.

159
00:27:00.753 --> 00:27:05.446
So, that's the, that's the beauty of innocence, that when you try to pamper the innocence,

160
00:27:05.516 --> 00:27:12.366
when you try to dote on the innocence, it emits the beauty.

161
00:27:20.196 --> 00:27:21.467
It relaxes you.

162
00:27:27.692 --> 00:27:34.665
If there is a little child and you want to kiss the child and you want to embrace the child

163
00:27:34.765 --> 00:27:39.029
and you want to love the child, it is you who is wanting, not the child.

164
00:27:49.463 --> 00:27:52.857
If you do not want it, you are abnormal.

165
00:27:55.989 --> 00:28:00.847
But if you want to dote on some one, then that should ‘relax’ that person,

166
00:28:00.956 --> 00:28:03.232
the one who does that.

167
00:28:07.922 --> 00:28:11.578
But if it is the other way round, that the other person gets

168
00:28:11.640 --> 00:28:14.822
tensed up and the person whom you dote, becomes ego-oriented,

169
00:28:14.876 --> 00:28:17.550
then it is all wrong, absolutely it is upside down.

170
00:28:27.132 --> 00:28:31.666
You get tensed up because you think that nothing should displease the person,

171
00:28:31.774 --> 00:28:34.436
you think the person needs it.

172
00:28:48.801 --> 00:28:50.375
Ther you go, you tell them.

173
00:28:54.367 --> 00:28:56.452
Mother.... I've forgotten...

174
00:28:57.165 --> 00:28:59.804
No, no, what I'm saing like this is that

175
00:28:59.804 --> 00:29:05.618
that you try to dote on the child thinking that that person, the child needs it.

176
00:29:05.781 --> 00:29:07.806
It is ‘you’ who need it.

177
00:29:16.837 --> 00:29:20.380
If you remember that that you need it, then why should you worry

178
00:29:20.411 --> 00:29:25.177
that if you do not do particular things the person will be displeased.

179
00:29:34.913 --> 00:29:38.545
So just by pleasing yourself you are really pleasing the other person.

180
00:29:38.568 --> 00:29:41.438
That, you see it that way.

181
00:29:44.942 --> 00:29:46.495
So this is wisdom:

182
00:29:47.906 --> 00:29:49.991
to see thing in right perspective.

183
00:29:53.200 --> 00:29:57.518
And that is what should come into everyone spontaneously.

184
00:30:02.153 --> 00:30:06.349
When that comes in, you become a complete personality.

185
00:30:09.970 --> 00:30:14.128
Ganesha is sufficient to make you complete, because He's complete.

186
00:30:19.577 --> 00:30:27.791
And as it is, for you people to do it, is easier because you are already

187
00:30:27.838 --> 00:30:31.560
at a point where Ganesha is pleased with you.

188
00:30:40.072 --> 00:30:43.253
Or we can say that you are pleased with yourself.

189
00:30:47.834 --> 00:30:51.554
So one should not feel hurt or should not feel bad.

190
00:30:51.593 --> 00:30:55.940
If somebody feels hurt or something, that means there's something lacking in that person.

191
00:31:04.288 --> 00:31:08.446
Such a personality is the personality where we can say

192
00:31:08.461 --> 00:31:13.054
that Shri Ganesha is residing with His all powers.

193
00:31:19.558 --> 00:31:23.742
But some people have the right Ganesha some have the left Ganesha powers.

194
00:31:31.758 --> 00:31:34.355
Both the types of powers must be developed.

195
00:31:40.479 --> 00:31:45.509
If a man has been licentious and very fond of the other sex and all that,

196
00:31:45.617 --> 00:31:52.510
he gets such a rebound that he becomes absolutely left side character.

197
00:32:05.913 --> 00:32:11.985
Supposing before realisation he is running after women, or the girl is running after the men.

198
00:32:12.512 --> 00:32:17.765
All that gets such а rebound that that he just doesn’t want to do that thing

199
00:32:17.827 --> 00:32:19.878
as afilth, he thinks its filth.

200
00:32:19.878 --> 00:32:24.264
That is one of the feelings comes in the mind of a person.

201
00:32:47.382 --> 00:32:53.082
Then he doesn’t hanker after this kind of nonsense.

202
00:33:03.222 --> 00:33:10.126
Like we have horrible names like heterosexsuans and homosexuals and all sexual sort.

203
00:33:10.126 --> 00:33:12.886
All that finishes off.

204
00:33:18.909 --> 00:33:29.540
Then you keep a healthy company of your type, of your sex, healthy company.

205
00:33:39.245 --> 00:33:41.571
But healthy and pure.

206
00:33:51.633 --> 00:33:53.275
Which is very natural.

207
00:33:55.554 --> 00:34:00.298
And the another extreme nature should not be followed.

208
00:34:12.127 --> 00:34:15.479
Like, I have also seen among some muslims, this is a habit:

209
00:34:15.572 --> 00:34:18.985
they're more attached to their daughters than to their wives.

210
00:34:19.039 --> 00:34:20.934
Funny thing. It's absurd.

211
00:34:26.590 --> 00:34:30.821
They pay more importance to the daughters than to the wife. It is something very absurd.

212
00:34:30.938 --> 00:34:33.842
It's not good. It’s again perversion.

213
00:34:39.874 --> 00:34:45.046
Or the women, they love their son more than their husband.

214
00:34:50.100 --> 00:34:51.363
It is absurd.

215
00:34:52.340 --> 00:34:57.549
And once it starts working like that, it can go in to any absurd limit

216
00:34:57.642 --> 00:35:02.409
which is not in the maryadas of Sahaja Yoga, in the boundaries of Sahaja Yoga.

217
00:35:11.781 --> 00:35:17.679
There has to be very healthy relationships. Friendship.

218
00:35:21.927 --> 00:35:26.247
But not attachment which looks funny and absurd.

219
00:35:30.743 --> 00:35:32.652
So nothing absurd should be done.

220
00:35:32.652 --> 00:35:35.224
No thing overly should be done.

221
00:35:40.108 --> 00:35:46.144
Because there will be a devorce and unnecessarilly heart burning for nothing at all, it's useless.

222
00:35:52.717 --> 00:35:56.609
Now, in Sahaja Yoga another very important point I have to tell you today,

223
00:35:56.671 --> 00:36:02.178
which is not so much besides Shri Ganesha’s point, which always we make mistakes.

224
00:36:02.255 --> 00:36:05.311
Then in India there have been lots of Mistakes like that.

225
00:36:16.590 --> 00:36:19.373
Now will give one example Mr. X you see,

226
00:36:19.427 --> 00:36:24.572
he is a great Sahaja Yogi in the sense he's good organiser, he has done this, he has done that,

227
00:36:24.626 --> 00:36:26.694
and we start adoring him.

228
00:36:35.407 --> 00:36:36.603
Or we may be jealous.

229
00:36:36.665 --> 00:36:39.935
One of the two things happen, either we adore or jealous.

230
00:36:43.819 --> 00:36:48.820
Now, if you adore that person, then you must follow it footsteps.

231
00:36:56.975 --> 00:37:00.511
And if you are jealous, then it is more reason that you follow his footsteps so you become

232
00:37:00.573 --> 00:37:02.856
his footsteps so you become like him.

233
00:37:08.988 --> 00:37:10.951
I'm talking of wisdom.

234
00:37:12.679 --> 00:37:17.699
Now, but instead of that when you adore, you will, even whether you are a boy or a girl,

235
00:37:17.753 --> 00:37:21.739
jump on him, you'll hug him, you'll kiss him, you do all kinds of non sensical things

236
00:37:21.801 --> 00:37:25.001
which is not needed to express that way.

237
00:37:37.249 --> 00:37:43.200
Like it happened with me that I was in London first time, you see.

238
00:37:43.215 --> 00:37:47.808
I’d never known all this and somebody who was quite hefty, you see, just came and hugged me

239
00:37:47.815 --> 00:37:52.106
and took me with him and I didn’t know where to look, I was apsolutely...

240
00:37:56.362 --> 00:37:59.355
And lifted me actualy.

241
00:38:13.937 --> 00:38:15.649
So much so I forgot English language,

242
00:38:15.649 --> 00:38:19.026
I told him in marathi: “Put me down, put me down!”.

243
00:38:31.188 --> 00:38:33.462
All that is. So it is quite funny.

244
00:38:33.470 --> 00:38:36.862
Eaven, I mean, I am not used to kissing at all, at all.

245
00:38:36.893 --> 00:38:40.216
Anybody kisses me, I get a fright you know.

246
00:38:50.185 --> 00:38:55.918
But I can kiss a lady or a young boy, little boy, I can kiss it, it's all right, that is done.

247
00:38:55.949 --> 00:39:00.333
But not every man, I can not kiss. It’s very funny, isn’t it?

248
00:39:11.023 --> 00:39:15.057
So this is a kind of adoration is not very wise.

249
00:39:18.312 --> 00:39:20.897
Adoration is to be felt in your heart.

250
00:39:23.851 --> 00:39:27.889
Like yesterday one other gentlemen put his hand so strong on me

251
00:39:27.912 --> 00:39:32.171
that for two minutes I was just trying to put it right.

252
00:39:40.357 --> 00:39:43.135
And the shaking hands is very horrible thing.

253
00:39:46.151 --> 00:39:53.710
Sometimes they feel unless and until they have taken out about a kilo of meat out of your hand: "I'm not taking the best.", you see.

254
00:40:10.183 --> 00:40:17.015
And this is how sometimes, you see, there is no maryadas left, even between ourselves.

255
00:40:17.062 --> 00:40:18.986
So there should be maryadas.

256
00:40:26.513 --> 00:40:28.145
Now, feeling jealousy is аnother thing.

257
00:40:28.177 --> 00:40:32.377
I have seen that when people feel jealous, they'd start coming and complaining against

258
00:40:32.416 --> 00:40:36.622
this person or that person or this. I know what it is.

259
00:40:47.204 --> 00:40:51.035
Jealousy is the worst curse anyone can have, I think,

260
00:40:51.120 --> 00:40:53.965
because, you see, then you can’t see anything that is good.

261
00:40:54.012 --> 00:40:57.508
Because you see a person is normal, you feel jealous of such a person.

262
00:41:08.120 --> 00:41:13.217
Then you feel: you are jealous so you have every right to do what you like.

263
00:41:18.496 --> 00:41:21.434
You just say: ”I am jealous of you, because you are so good.

264
00:41:21.458 --> 00:41:24.135
So, now I can be very bad."

265
00:41:32.794 --> 00:41:35.886
I mean, first it started with people telling that this is

266
00:41:35.917 --> 00:41:38.824
jealousy which is a bad thing, it was all right.

267
00:41:38.855 --> 00:41:44.745
But now the bad thing is taken as a a... what you call...

268
00:41:44.830 --> 00:41:48.649
a blackmail, you see. Use it for a blackmailing others.

269
00:41:48.711 --> 00:41:50.927
They say: “Oh, alright! I am a bad man, so I am a bad man.

270
00:41:50.974 --> 00:41:53.471
You are a good man. Alright, so what?”

271
00:41:53.518 --> 00:41:57.018
It's like that. To use it as a power.

272
00:42:10.083 --> 00:42:12.955
Like yesterday one madman came, lunatic.

273
00:42:16.110 --> 00:42:20.119
Now, when he came, the lunatic, he wanted to sit in front.

274
00:42:23.422 --> 00:42:28.105
And he just started taking advantage of his lunacy!

275
00:42:33.004 --> 00:42:35.993
That if he is a lunatic, he can behave the way he likes.

276
00:42:39.249 --> 00:42:41.747
Because you are a drunkard you can behave the way you like.

277
00:42:44.925 --> 00:42:47.300
Now, what is the wisdom?

278
00:42:47.338 --> 00:42:49.011
Where is it lost?

279
00:42:49.081 --> 00:42:51.350
It's ridiculous.

280
00:42:52.442 --> 00:42:55.321
So, one has to be wise.

281
00:42:55.360 --> 00:42:59.158
When you are dealing with it, the wisdom is your glory.

282
00:43:07.685 --> 00:43:12.385
By wisdom you will be fair to yourself and fair to others.

283
00:43:20.594 --> 00:43:24.061
Wisdom is like an ocean, one can not describe it in one lecture.

284
00:43:28.915 --> 00:43:31.373
Just try to enjoy your wisdom.

285
00:43:33.575 --> 00:43:36.432
And the greatest wisdom of Shri Ganesha was that

286
00:43:36.463 --> 00:43:39.523
he was surrendered to his Mother, that's all. He's not bothered.

287
00:43:48.027 --> 00:43:52.034
And when you are surrendered then you just understand that

288
00:43:52.095 --> 00:43:56.232
you give up your ego and superego to your Mother to bother about it,

289
00:43:56.270 --> 00:44:00.052
and you live with your innocence.

290
00:44:13.145 --> 00:44:17.746
And to understand also in a very gross way, we can say,

291
00:44:17.777 --> 00:44:21.308
to have Ganesha Tattwa,

292
00:44:21.315 --> 00:44:27.043
Ganesha Principle developed in you, you must eat things which are emitting Ganesha Principle.

293
00:44:27.121 --> 00:44:32.783
Like the Chana (chickpeas), like I found out the Hazelnut.

294
00:44:32.822 --> 00:44:39.070
Then you can see that you should use lot of these lemons, you see is a good idea.

295
00:44:39.086 --> 00:44:41.683
All these give you a good Ganesha Tattwa.

296
00:45:01.613 --> 00:45:07.537
So all these things should be used and there are many other things one can see that

297
00:45:07.615 --> 00:45:11.083
which help you to develop your Ganesha Tattwa.

298
00:45:11.106 --> 00:45:15.102
But the highest of all is to control your eyes.

299
00:45:15.133 --> 00:45:20.218
Not to see anything that is tempting.

300
00:45:32.753 --> 00:45:38.452
So put your eyes on the ground.

301
00:45:38.452 --> 00:45:47.509
Just watch your eyes when another sex arrives or there, how do you look at that person, with greed, with lust.

302
00:46:00.983 --> 00:46:07.203
And if you understand that, then you will start clearing your eyes very well.

303
00:46:12.932 --> 00:46:18.220
Another thing is, physically, you should try to do one or two exercises

304
00:46:18.258 --> 00:46:24.223
to be able to put yourself flat on the Mother Earth, because that helps.

305
00:46:33.665 --> 00:46:41.032
So before we use the meditation to Shri Ganesha, you must always do that exercise, to loosen

306
00:46:41.094 --> 00:46:46.499
the muscles so that you touch the Mother Earth in a more flat way.

307
00:46:59.453 --> 00:47:01.197
It will help.

308
00:47:05.817 --> 00:47:10.919
So for today I think I have said sufficiently.
